"the mouse pointer is over will become active (receive focus)."
msgstr ""
"ये वो अंतराल हे जेखर बाद वो विंडो, जेखर ऊपर मुसुवा सूचक रखे जाथे , वो अपने अपन सक्रिय "
"होथे  (फोकस पाथे )."

#: windows.cpp:244
msgid ""
"This is the delay after which the window the mouse pointer is over will "
"automatically receive focus."
msgstr ""
"ये वो अंतराल हे जेखर बाद वो विंडो, जेखर ऊपर मुसुवा सूचक रखे जाथे , वो अपने अपन फोकस पाथे ."

#: windows.cpp:247
msgid "S&eparate screen focus"
msgstr "अलग स्क्रीन फोकस (&e) "

#: windows.cpp:249
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, focus operations are limited only to the active "
"Xinerama screen"
msgstr ""
"जब ए विकल्प सक्छम होथे , फोकस आपरेसन सिरिफ सक्रिय सिनेरेमा स्क्रीन मं सीमित होथे ."

#: windows.cpp:252
msgid "Active screen follows &mouse"
msgstr "सक्रिय स्क्रीन मुसुआ के पीछू रहिही (&m)"

#: windows.cpp:254
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, the active Xinerama screen (where new windows "
"appear, for example) is the screen containing the mouse pointer. When "
"disabled, the active Xinerama screen is the  screen containing the focused "
"window. By default this option is disabled for Click to focus and enabled "
"for other focus policies."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:274
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Window Switching"
msgstr "विंडो स्विचिंग"

#: windows.cpp:277
msgid "Show window list while switching windows"
msgstr "विंडोज मं स्विच करे मं विंडो सूची देखाव"

#: windows.cpp:280
msgid ""
"Hold down the Alt key and press the Tab key repeatedly to walk through the "
"windows on the current desktop (the Alt+Tab combination can be "
"reconfigured).\n"
"\n"
"If this checkbox is checked a popup widget is shown, displaying the icons of "
"all windows to walk through and the title of the currently selected one.\n"
"\n"
"Otherwise, the focus is passed to a new window each time Tab is pressed, "
"with no popup widget.  In addition, the previously activated window will be "
"sent to the back in this mode."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:293
msgid "&Traverse windows on all desktops"
msgstr "सब्बो डेस्कटाप मं विंडो ट्रावर करव (&T)"

#: windows.cpp:296
msgid ""
"Leave this option disabled if you want to limit walking through windows to "
"the current desktop."
msgstr ""
"ये विकल्प ल अक्छम ही रहन देव यदि आप मन चाहथो कि अभी हाल के डेस्कटाप के विंडोज मं आर "
"पार जाय के सीमा हो."

#: windows.cpp:301
msgid "Desktop navi&gation wraps around"
msgstr "डेस्कटाप नेविगेसन रैप्स अराउंड (&g)"

#: windows.cpp:304
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want keyboard or active desktop border navigation "
"beyond the edge of a desktop to take you to the opposite edge of the new "
"desktop."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:309
msgid "Popup desktop name on desktop &switch"
msgstr "डेस्कटाप स्विच मं पापअप डेस्कटाप नाम (&s)"

#: windows.cpp:312
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you wish to see the current desktop name popup "
"whenever the current desktop is changed."
msgstr ""
"ये विकल्प ल सक्छम करव यदि आप मन चाहथो कि अभी हाल के डेस्कटाप के नाम पापअप हो दिखे जब "
"अभी हाल के डेस्कटाप बदले जाए."

#: windows.cpp:624
msgid "Shading"
msgstr "छइंहा"

#: windows.cpp:627
msgid "&Enable hover"
msgstr "हावर सक्छम करव (&E)"

#: windows.cpp:637
msgid ""
"If Shade Hover is enabled, a shaded window will un-shade automatically when "
"the mouse pointer has been over the title bar for some time."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:640
msgid ""
"Sets the time in milliseconds before the window unshades when the mouse "
"pointer goes over the shaded window."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:644
msgid "Dela&y:"
msgstr "देरी: (&y)"

#: windows.cpp:658
msgid "Active Desktop Borders"
msgstr "सक्रिय डेस्कटाप किनोर"

#: windows.cpp:661
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, moving the mouse to a screen border will change "
"your desktop. This is e.g. useful if you want to drag windows from one "
"desktop to the other."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:664
msgid "D&isabled"
msgstr "अक्छम (&i)"

#: windows.cpp:666
msgid "Only &when moving windows"
msgstr "सिरिफ तभी जब विंडो खिसकाय जाय (&w)"

#: windows.cpp:668
msgid "A&lways enabled"
msgstr "हमेसा सक्छम: (&l)"

#: windows.cpp:674
msgid ""
"Here you can set a delay for switching desktops using the active borders "
"feature. Desktops will be switched after the mouse has been pushed against a "
"screen border for the specified number of milliseconds."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:678
msgid "Desktop &switch delay:"
msgstr "डेस्कटाप स्विच देरीः (&s)"

#: windows.cpp:698
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "स्मार्ट"

#: windows.cpp:699
msgid "Maximizing"
msgstr "सबसे बड़े बनात हे"

#: windows.cpp:700
msgid "Cascade"
msgstr "एक के बाद एक"

#: windows.cpp:701
msgid "Random"
msgstr "बेतरतीब"

#: windows.cpp:702
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "बीचोंबीच"

#: windows.cpp:703
msgid "Zero-Cornered"
msgstr "जीरो-कार्नर्ड"

#: windows.cpp:710
msgid ""
"The placement policy determines where a new window will appear on the "
"desktop. <ul> <li><em>Smart</em> will try to achieve a minimum overlap of "
"windows</li> <li><em>Maximizing</em> will try to maximize every window to "
"fill the whole screen. It might be useful to selectively affect placement of "
"some windows using the window-specific settings.</li> <li><em>Cascade</em> "
"will cascade the windows</li> <li><em>Random</em> will use a random "
"position</li> <li><em>Centered</em> will place the window centered</li> "
"<li><em>Zero-Cornered</em> will place the window in the top-left corner</"
"li></ul>"
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:726
msgid "&Placement:"
msgstr "स्थिति: (&P)"

#: windows.cpp:734
msgid "Hide utility windows for inactive applications"
msgstr "अक्रिय अनुपरयोग मन बर यूटिलिटि विंडो लुकाव."

#: windows.cpp:736
msgid ""
"When turned on, utility windows (tool windows, torn-off menus,...) of "
"inactive applications will be hidden and will be shown only when the "
"application becomes active. Note that applications have to mark the windows "
"with the proper window type for this feature to work."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:945
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "विंडोज"

#: windows.cpp:952
msgid "Di&splay content in moving windows"
msgstr "खिसकाय जावत विंडो के चीज देखाव (&s)"

#: windows.cpp:954
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be fully shown while "
"moving it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not "
"be satisfying on slow machines without graphic acceleration."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:958
msgid "Display content in &resizing windows"
msgstr "नवा आकार दे जावत विंडो के चीज देखाव (&r)"

#: windows.cpp:960
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be shown while resizing "
"it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not be "
"satisfying on slow machines."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:964
msgid "Display window &geometry when moving or resizing"
msgstr "खिसकाय या नवा आकार दे जात समय विंडो ज्यामिती देखाव (&g)"

#: windows.cpp:966
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's geometry to be displayed while it "
"is being moved or resized. The window position relative to the top-left "
"corner of the screen is displayed together with its size."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:976
msgid "Allow moving and resizing o&f maximized windows"
msgstr "विंडो ल खिसकाय अउ नवा आकार दे के अनुमति देव (&f)"

#: windows.cpp:978
msgid ""
"When enabled, this feature activates the border of maximized windows and "
"allows you to move or resize them, just like for normal windows"
msgstr ""
"जब सक्छम होथे  तहां ए फीचर सबसे बड़े करे गे विंडो किनारे ल सक्रिय कर देथे  अउ आप मन ल ओला "
"नवा आकार दे या खिसकाय देथे  जइसन कि आम विंडो मं होथे ."

#: windows.cpp:1006
msgid "Snap Zones"
msgstr "स्नेप जोन्स"

#: windows.cpp:1010 windows.cpp:1024 windows.cpp:1038
msgid "none"
msgstr "कुछ नइ"

#: windows.cpp:1013
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for screen borders, i.e. the 'strength' of "
"the magnetic field which will make windows snap to the border when moved "
"near it."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:1017
msgid "&Border snap zone:"
msgstr "बार्डर स्नैप जोनः (&B)"

#: windows.cpp:1027
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for windows, i.e. the 'strength' of the "
"magnetic field which will make windows snap to each other when they are "
"moved near another window."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:1031
msgid "&Window snap zone:"
msgstr "विंडो स्नैप जोनः (&W)"

#: windows.cpp:1041
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for the screen center, i.e. the 'strength' of "
"the magnetic field which will make windows snap to the center of the screen "
"when moved near it."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:1045
msgid "&Center snap zone:"
msgstr "सेंटर स्नैप जोनः (&C)"

#: windows.cpp:1051
msgid "Snap windows onl&y when overlapping"
msgstr "जब ओवरलेपिंग हो तभी विंडो स्नेप करव (&y)"

#: windows.cpp:1052
msgid ""
"Here you can set that windows will be only snapped if you try to overlap "
"them, i.e. they will not be snapped if the windows comes only near another "
"window or border."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:1116 windows.cpp:1120 windows.cpp:1124
msgid " pixel"
msgid_plural " pixels"
msgstr[0] "पिक्सेल"
msgstr[1] "पिक्सेल"

